{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02749","headline":"中和乐九章 歌中宫第五 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌中宫第五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祥游沙麓，庆洽瑶衣。\n黄云昼聚，白气宵飞。\n居中履正，禀和体微。\n仪刑赤县，演教椒闱。\n陶钧万国，丹青四妃。\n河洲在咏，风化攸归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}